{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_022_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:75d8662ae57db9bde169e73d6039f79d2151f94bf284f5a8ffe392813bcca793",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4276fb286c11dad38899c99975c1121f4603b243dc515856591c669421cd5d32",
      "text": "那个……●●●●プロデューサー……\n这个……是情人节的，回礼……哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd7261b18872e4f1dc4927047f3887e1858a9cf59bca8239b2075f5821df1c3",
      "text": "因为一直以来……都承蒙●●●●プロデューサー\n的照顾……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d13aa418a921d15d8fe1eb85481393f15b8510162e3add34442bdffd3a591c86",
      "text": "想送一份能让你开心的东西……\n苦恼了很久……才选出来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f634bf9ed6856c2e192786366bea5f71ac84d50ec11177617d6de9db769d1426",
      "text": "……呵呵，你能高兴，太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a641731e25fee0a19b119a56b44ff57031dcbfd34c3dd6dd64580b927456a78",
      "text": "今后也请多指教呢，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02a1d6a25477b063ae12297fe24f5af4f8ca62f5a4b0ededd8f45681f2aefc45",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……辛苦了。\n有想交给你的，东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd30b7c62b97be377d35f22d3806d5217ffb35f4656c28080e3d23a6092c538",
      "text": "这个……是情人节的，回礼。\n巧克力……非常美味，哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea824972f0c1b10cc7825904ebe14e831f3ad14f6ec5002b869f0c5498dd7ca",
      "text": "呵呵……你能高兴，太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51d480cd4b89585c6884fdce06e3b95b998dcb466166a852e594db793ae6b526",
      "text": "要是●●●●プロデューサー，\n开心的话……我也会，非常开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c534d4ab82c00267dd857e4cbebfa99b644b10a88ab874d71c5e27390295da3",
      "text": "呐……●●●●プロデューサー在情人节的时候……\n也是，这样的心情……吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c82d843b23d0f3db25bc96dd25bfa9199593bbdeed4e25f0c1ae7953c95ae79f",
      "text": "一定也是同样的心情哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:354a6c2912ef418cea4414c419a3a58a4bddb68598a1b3da2a8ab40fccafe4e8",
      "text": "是的。非常开心哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3d9ab5fa998e0d6ab7fb342228ea9abd44cf463a9259d8c5b7bfd8487c76b1f",
      "text": "这样啊……呵呵，同样的心情……\n总觉得，真好……呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:505b300fe7656a1500ee0d340bcf75d79eade1b47dec06c0361cad9d6d932a73",
      "text": "因为从制作人那里，\n收到了很多……心意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_022_22:5_02_022_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90dd362f85f8b03a9bc133e83182a00e8328d3ff7350cfb9b99820eb0de6f7cf",
      "text": "今后我也会加油，的哦……\n请多指教……●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
